1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,910
If someone pointed this laser at you,

2
00:00:01,910 --> 00:00:02,720
you could hear a voice

3
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,950
that nobody beside you hears.

4
00:00:04,950 --> 00:00:05,630
And you wouldn’t need

5
00:00:05,630 --> 00:00:07,160
anything in your ears.

6
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:08,850
The beam is invisible.

7
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:10,400
But when water vapor near your ear

8
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:11,560
absorbs its light,

9
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,220
it heats up and expands—

10
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:15,110
creating tiny sound waves.

11
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:16,400
Now, sweeping that beam

12
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,780
at exactly the right speed

13
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:18,940
concentrates the sound

14
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:20,060
where you’re standing.

15
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:21,750
Scientists actually demonstrated this

16
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:23,330
from eight feet away.

17
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:24,220
But if someone walks

18
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:26,270
between you and the laser…

19
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:28,060
The voice suddenly stops.

20
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:29,410
They can’t hear your message.

21
00:00:29,410 --> 00:00:30,700
They’re blocking it.

22
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:32,270
And the second they move…

23
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:34,067
You hear it again.

